[en.FOCUS_C04_INVESTIGATE_WASHOUTS]
Investigate Washouts

[en.FOCUS_C04_INVESTIGATE_WASHOUTS_desc]
Since the Ultimate Battle, the Washouts have been active in the border areas of the Greater Cloudsdale region, and even once became a temporary security force enlisted by the Empire. After the Empire lost its dominance in the Cloudsdale region, they turned to some gray businesses and colluded with the Cloudsdale Chamber of Commerce. Now they arrogantly show up in Stratusburg with the support of the Empire, obviously indicating some bad intentions.

[zh.FOCUS_C04_INVESTIGATE_WASHOUTS]
对淘汰者的调查

[zh.FOCUS_C04_INVESTIGATE_WASHOUTS_desc]
自终末之战以来，淘汰者长期在大云中城地区的边界地带活动，也一度成为帝国官方收编的临时安保部队。帝国在云中城地区失去支配地位后，他们就转而从事一些灰色生意，并与云中城商业委员会有所勾结。这次他们大摇大摆地访问层云堡，背后有帝国的支持，显然来者不善。

